At Wed, 17 Dec 2014 17:45:20 +0100,
Jurgen Kramer wrote:
> 
> This patch adds native DSD support for two XMOS based DACs from Matrix Audio:
> - X-Sabre
> - Mini-i Pro
> 
> Signed-off-by: Jurgen Kramer <gtmkramer@xs4all.nl>

Applied, thanks.


